## Key Concepts

- Per-client FIFO queues to preserve order
- Global bounded capacity and backpressure signaling
- Central arbiter with fair slot distribution (round-robin or weighted)
- Cancellations and fault tolerance across nodes
- Test methodology: ordering guarantees, fairness under burst, tail latency, failover behavior

