## Why This Is Asked
This question probes handling per-key ordering under global backpressure, a common real-world pattern in notification systems. It also tests a candidate's ability to define a clear degradation path and a practical test plan.

## Key Concepts
- Bounded queues
- Per-user ordering
- Backpressure and fairness
- Degradation through coalescing

